    "summary": "On 10-core Apple Silicon (4P+6E) running Windows 11 ARM64 under QEMU+HVF + Prism x86_64 translation + VirtIO-GPU 3D (DXMT-native), Phase 11-14 full-stack optimization has largely exhausted host I/O, networking, shader cache, frame pacing, and input overheads. The remaining dominant bottleneck is single-thread x86_64->ARM64 Prism translation + UE4 GameThread/RenderThread execution inside the guest.",
